{%- doc -%}
  The Quick View button that sits on a PLP card, revealed on card hover.

  Styling and the hover reveal live in tailwind.css against `.spy-quick-view-btn`,
  so the block and the grouped card share one look. `spy-quick-view.js` reads the
  handle off the button and fills the modal.

  @param {object} product - product the modal opens
  @param {string} [shopify_attributes] - block attributes, when a block renders it

  @example
  {%- render 'spy-quick-view-button', product: product -%}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- if product != blank -%}
  {%- comment -%} Source: 12px regular, no tracking. Pull-up and hover reveal live in tailwind.css {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    No transition utility here: utilities compile !important and would override the
    card rule in tailwind.css, which fades it in 0.2s and delays the hide so Tab can
    move onto it from the card link.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <button
    class="spy-quick-view-btn py-2 px-3 bg-white border border-spy-orange-ui text-spy-orange-ui text-[12px] font-normal uppercase tracking-normal cursor-pointer text-center hover:bg-spy-orange-ui hover:text-white"
    data-spy-qv="{{ product.handle }}"
    aria-label="Quick View {{ product.title | escape }}"
    type="button"
    {{ shopify_attributes }}
  >Quick View</button>
{%- endif -%}
